    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SSC302m · Assessment 3/4</span>\n<h2>Assignment 3</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 14118 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">SSC302m · Đầu điểm 3/4</span>\n<h2>Assignment 3</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 14118 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">20.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">20''/group of 2-&gt;3 members</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1-&gt;10</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">This group project will involve crafting and delivering a persuasive speech on a real-life scenario where someone needs to change a negative behavior.</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Knowledge and skills in studied content from sessions 1-&gt;17</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Students work in group of 2-&gt;3 (Students may form their own groups or assigned by teacher)<br>Students are informed and preprared beforehand.<br>Student presents in classroom<br>Choose a bad habit/bahaviour that is common and relatable to your audience (e.g., procrastination, social media overuse, unhealthy snacking).<br>Create a realistic scenario where a person struggles with this habit and experiences its negative effects.<br>Focus on a positive outcome where the person successfully breaks the habit using your proposed plan.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 10 — Speak to Inform: Assignment 1 - Deliver a five- to seven-minute speech on a topic of your choosing</li><li>Session 11 — Speak to Inform: Assignment 1 - Deliver a five- to seven-minute speech on a topic of your choosing</li><li>Session 12 — Speak to Inform: Assignment 1 - Deliver a five- to seven-minute speech on a topic of your choosing</li><li>Session 13 — Speak to Inform: Assignment 1 (Cont) - Deliver a five- to seven-minute speech on a topic of your choosing</li><li>Session 14 — Speak to Inform: Assignment 1 (Cont) - Deliver a five- to seven-minute speech on a topic of your choosing</li><li>Session 15 — Speak to Inform: Assignment 1 (Cont) - Deliver a five- to seven-minute speech on a topic of your choosing</li><li>Session 34 — Assignment 2 (group work)</li><li>Session 35 — Assignment 2 (group work)</li><li>Session 36 — Assignment 2 (group work)</li><li>Session 52 — Assignment 3 (Groupwork)</li><li>Session 53 — Assignment 3 (Groupwork)</li><li>Session 54 — Assignment 3 (Groupwork)</li><li>Session 55 — Assignment 3 (Cont)</li><li>Session 56 — Assignment 3 (Cont)</li><li>Session 57 — Assignment 3 (Cont)</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 10 — Speak to Inform: Assignment 1 - Deliver a five- to seven-minute speech on a topic of your choosing</li><li>Buổi 11 — Speak to Inform: Assignment 1 - Deliver a five- to seven-minute speech on a topic of your choosing</li><li>Buổi 12 — Speak to Inform: Assignment 1 - Deliver a five- to seven-minute speech on a topic of your choosing</li><li>Buổi 13 — Speak to Inform: Assignment 1 (Cont) - Deliver a five- to seven-minute speech on a topic of your choosing</li><li>Buổi 14 — Speak to Inform: Assignment 1 (Cont) - Deliver a five- to seven-minute speech on a topic of your choosing</li><li>Buổi 15 — Speak to Inform: Assignment 1 (Cont) - Deliver a five- to seven-minute speech on a topic of your choosing</li><li>Buổi 34 — Assignment 2 (group work)</li><li>Buổi 35 — Assignment 2 (group work)</li><li>Buổi 36 — Assignment 2 (group work)</li><li>Buổi 52 — Assignment 3 (Groupwork)</li><li>Buổi 53 — Assignment 3 (Groupwork)</li><li>Buổi 54 — Assignment 3 (Groupwork)</li><li>Buổi 55 — Assignment 3 (Cont)</li><li>Buổi 56 — Assignment 3 (Cont)</li><li>Buổi 57 — Assignment 3 (Cont)</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">No practice paper for this subject in the Exam Room yet.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p class=\"ghi-chu\">Phòng thi chưa có đề luyện cho môn này.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
